flowchart TD
  A[Commit / Pull Request] --> B[Lint and type checks]
  B --> C[Unit and migration tests]
  C --> D[Dependency/container scan]
  D --> E[Build immutable images]
  E --> F[Deploy staging]
  F --> G[Integration, security and AI eval]
  G --> H[UAT and release approval]
  H --> I[Backup and migration plan]
  I --> J[Deploy production]
  J --> K[Health checks and smoke tests]
  K --> L[Monitor]
  K -->|Failure| R[Rollback / disable feature]
